content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Mall Manager",
      "description": "person responsible for planning layouts and managing mall operations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mall Layout",
      "description": "overall arrangement of mall areas and shop placements"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mall Space",
      "description": "physical unit within the mall assigned to a shop"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tenant Request",
      "description": "request submitted by a shop owner for changes or support"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shop Owner",
      "description": "person managing a shop and its operations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Display",
      "description": "visual arrangement of merchandise to attract customers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory",
      "description": "record of goods available in a shop"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shop",
      "description": "retail location within the mall"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sales Records",
      "description": "logs of transactions and revenue for a shop"
    },
    {
      "name": "Security Officer",
      "description": "person responsible for maintaining safety in the mall"
    },
    {
      "name": "Patrol",
      "description": "security check performed across mall spaces"
    },
    {
      "name": "Emergency Response",
      "description": "action taken to handle incidents or emergencies"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "visitor who shops and interacts with mall services"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "customer input on mall or shop experience"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Security": {
      "objects": [
        "Security Officer",
        "Patrol",
        "Emergency Response"
      ]
    },
    "Administration": {
      "objects": [
        "Mall Manager",
        "Mall Layout",
        "Mall Space",
        "Shop",
        "Tenant Request"
      ]
    },
    "Shop Keeping": {
      "objects": [
        "Shop Owner",
        "Shop",
        "Sales Records",
        "Inventory",
        "Display"
      ]
    },
    "Customer Experience": {
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Feedback"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Security": {
      "derived from": "Security Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Security Officer",
        "Patrol",
        "Emergency Response"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Administration": {
      "derived from": "Administration Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Mall Manager",
        "Mall Layout",
        "Mall Space",
        "Shop Assignment",
        "Tenant Request"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Shop -> Shop Assignment"
      ]
    },
    "Shop Keeping": {
      "derived from": "Shop Keeping Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Shop Owner",
        "Shop",
        "Sales Records",
        "Inventory",
        "Display"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Customer Experience": {
      "derived from": "Customer Experience Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Feedback"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
